generators first, then reads the factor labels. -/
theorem routeBPaperFaithfulTPhi_strictSourceDecodedTransitionWordOnFactors_distrib_eq_nil_of_not_mem
    {M : DTM} {n : ℕ} {hn2 : n ≥ 2}
